00:18:05,110 --> 00:18:07,652
Allô ?

404
00:18:11,259 --> 00:18:13,195
Test d'écoute

405
00:18:13,195 --> 00:18:15,345
Allô ?

406
00:18:18,435 --> 00:18:21,735
Test d'écoute

407
